# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in as needed.
# Nothing here is committed; never paste real secrets into a tracked file.

# ── API keys (only needed for the Tier 3 autonomous LLM-based metrics) ─────────
# Tiers 0–2 (efficiency, BSARD replication, supervised IR) need NO API key.
# Tier 3 (UMBRELA, eRAG via API, RAGAS WA/WB) calls the OpenAI API.
# The OpenAI SDK reads this variable automatically.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ── Tier 3 — eRAG via a local Ollama endpoint (no API key) ─────────────────────
# To run eRAG locally instead of via the OpenAI API, pass an "ollama/<model>"
# model name to the harness (e.g. "ollama/llama3.1:8b"). The code then targets
# http://localhost:11434/v1 and no OPENAI_API_KEY is required for that component.

# ── Optional: redirect the Hugging Face model cache off the system drive ───────
# Relevant only for Tier 3 components that download models (e.g. ARES, local eRAG).
# HF_HOME=/absolute/path/to/hf_models
